    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you present your Holy Symbol and expend a use of your Channel Divinity to make a ranged spell attack, hurling a bolt of holy energy at one creature within 60 feet of you. On a hit, the target takes Radiant damage equal to 2d10 plus your Wisdom modifier, and you can choose a creature you can see within 60 feet of you to regain Hit Points equal to 1d10 plus your Wisdom modifier.</p>",
